  "summary": "diffutils vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that GNU diffutils incorrectly handled certain integer\narithmetic when mapping line ranges in diff3. A local attacker could\npossibly use this issue to cause diff3 to crash, resulting in a denial of\nservice.",
